  "prefLabel": "Plc 1602.05 Health care facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1602.05 “Health care facility” means a facility that provides medical care that is required to be administered by licensed medical personnel. The term includes, but is not limited to, hospitals, nursing homes, extended care facilities, residential care facilities, hospice houses, and clinics. The term does not include home health agencies licensed and operated under RSA 151:2-b.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1600.html"
